            "slot": "s567",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · The skin on our hands is thin and flex…",
            "text": "The skin on our hands is thin and flexible and as we age and lose collagen, our hands develop a crepey texture and appearance. How to prevent this: daily moisturizing, active ingredients like Bakuchiol, Niacinamide and Hyaluronic Acid plump the skin, restore elasticity and improve tone and texture.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
