            "repere": "Intertitre · Brown Spots & Hyperpigmentation",
            "text": "Brown Spots & Hyperpigmentation",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s574",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Constant exposure to UV (from the sun …",
            "text": "Constant exposure to UV (from the sun or gel lamps) cause dark spots to appear on the tops of our hands. How to prevent this: SPF is essential to protect your hands, but ingredients like gallic acid and vitamin C work to fade the spots and brighten skin if they have already appeared.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
