            "slot": "s579",
            "repere": "Intertitre · Brittle Damaged Nails",
            "text": "Brittle Damaged Nails",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s581",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Years of manicures can take a toll on …",
            "text": "Years of manicures can take a toll on our nails. Brittle, dehydrated, thin nails can make your hands look older than they are. How to prevent this: treat your nails to active ingredients like biotin and keratin to strengthen, hydrate and repair nails in between manicures. This will also keep your cuticles healthy and soft.",
